<view class="dj-page"><view class="dj-title">探索成都，收集印记</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="dj-error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{tasks.demo}}" class="dj-demo">演示按钮模拟上游已核验结果；真实参与请使用宿主入口。</view><view wx:if="{{tasks}}"><view class="dj-panel"><view class="dj-subtitle">每日签到 +{{tasks.rewards.daily}}</view><button bindtap="daily" disabled="{{busy || tasks.counts.daily}}">{{tasks.counts.daily ? '今日已签到' : '签到'}}</button></view><view class="dj-panel"><view class="dj-subtitle">地点打卡 +{{tasks.rewards['checkin.verified']}}</view><view class="dj-note">今日奖励 {{tasks.counts['checkin.verified'] || 0}} / {{tasks.caps['checkin.verified']}}，超上限仍记录新地点章。</view><view wx:for="{{tasks.places}}" wx:key="id" class="dj-divider"><view>{{item.name}} · {{item.completed ? '已记录地点章' : '等待上游核验'}}</view><button class="dj-secondary" data-kind="打卡" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="host">去打卡</button><button wx:if="{{tasks.demo}}" class="dj-secondary" data-type="checkin.verified" data-field="placeId" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="demo" disabled="{{busy}}">演示：模拟已核验打卡</button></view></view>
<view class="dj-panel"><view class="dj-subtitle">消费参与 +{{tasks.rewards['purchase.verified']}}</view><view class="dj-note">今日奖励 {{tasks.counts['purchase.verified'] || 0}} / {{tasks.caps['purchase.verified']}}；同店每日一次。</view><view wx:for="{{tasks.merchants}}" wx:key="*this"><view>{{item}} · 等待消费服务核验</view><button class="dj-secondary" data-kind="消费" data-id="{{item}}" bindtap="host">去消费</button><button wx:if="{{tasks.demo}}" class="dj-secondary" data-type="purchase.verified" data-field="merchantId" data-id="{{item}}" bindtap="demo" disabled="{{busy}}">演示：模拟已确认消费</button></view></view>
<view class="dj-panel"><view class="dj-subtitle">文化体验 +{{tasks.rewards['culture_task.completed']}}</view><view class="dj-note">今日奖励 {{tasks.counts['culture_task.completed'] || 0}} / {{tasks.caps['culture_task.completed']}}；同任务每活动一次。</view><view wx:for="{{tasks.tasks}}" wx:key="*this"><view>{{item}}</view><button class="dj-secondary" data-kind="文化体验" data-id="{{item}}" bindtap="host">去参与体验</button><button wx:if="{{tasks.demo}}" class="dj-secondary" data-type="culture_task.completed" data-field="taskId" data-id="{{item}}" bindtap="demo" disabled="{{busy}}">演示：模拟体验已完成</button></view></view>
<view class="dj-panel"><view class="dj-subtitle">完整路线 +{{tasks.rewards['route.completed']}}</view><view class="dj-note">每活动一次；路线至少 3 个不同地点，必须已有全部有效地点记录。</view><view wx:for="{{tasks.routes}}" wx:key="id"><button class="dj-secondary" data-kind="路线" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="host">查看路线 {{item.id}}</button><button wx:if="{{tasks.demo}}" class="dj-secondary" data-type="route.completed" data-field="routeId" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="demo" disabled="{{busy}}">演示：提交路线完成结果</button></view></view></view><button class="dj-secondary" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新任务状态</button></view>
